{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%@ of %@" : {
      "comment" : "Where the thumb on the edge of a long text points, in bytes of the whole text, shown while it is held and read by VoiceOver: 126 KiB of 252 KiB. The placeholders are sizes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%2$@中の%1$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@，共%2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@，共%2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ unpacked" : {
      "comment" : "What the files of a bug report make when they are unpacked, under its name on its first page: 653 KiB unpacked. The placeholder is a size.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "展開後%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解压后%@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "解壓縮後%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@" : {
      "comment" : "The count and the total size of the attachments (2 attachments · 3.4 MiB), and of the entries of a bug report in the viewer.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%@ · %@. Some mail services refuse mail over 20 MiB." : {
      "comment" : "The same line when the attachments are over 20 MiB: the count, the total size and the warning.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@。20 MiBを超えるメールを受け付けないメールサービスがあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@。部分邮件服务会拒收超过20 MiB的邮件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ · %2$@。部分郵件服務會拒收超過20 MiB的郵件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld attachments are no longer available, so they were taken out of the list. Check the list, then send again." : {
      "comment" : "The message of the alert when Send finds that several attachments added earlier are gone or can no longer be read, and takes them out of the list. The number is at least 2.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld件の添付ファイルが利用できなくなったため、リストから削除しました。リストを確認して、もう一度送信してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有%lld个附件已不可用，因此已从列表中移除。请检查列表，然后再次发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有%lld個附件已無法使用，因此已從列表中移除。請檢查列表，然後再傳送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld items weren’t added" : {
      "comment" : "The title of the alert when two or more chosen items could not be copied; the number is at least 2.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld件の項目を追加できませんでした"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有%lld个项目未添加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有%lld個項目未加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld attachment](inflect: true)" : {
      "comment" : "The count of attached files under the rows of the mail, and its VoiceOver reading. English agrees the noun with the number; Chinese and Japanese have one form.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添付ファイル%lld件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld个附件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld個附件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld file](inflect: true)" : {
      "comment" : "The count of the files of a bug report, in its row on the sheet and under its name on its first page, and its VoiceOver reading, and the count of the files in one of its folders, under the folder's name. English agrees the noun with the number; Chinese and Japanese have one form.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld個のファイル"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld个文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld個檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "^[%lld second](inflect: true)" : {
      "comment" : "The length of an attached video as VoiceOver reads it. English agrees the noun with the number; Chinese and Japanese have one form.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld秒"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld秒"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld秒"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A bug report and a screenshot need the virtual machine to finish starting. The start log is attached." : {
      "comment" : "The line under that title: a bug report and a screenshot wait for the start, and the start log is already attached as a row.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バグレポートとスクリーンショットには、仮想マシンの起動完了が必要です。起動ログを添付しています。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "错误报告和截屏需要等虚拟机启动完成。启动日志已附上。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "錯誤報告和截圖需要等虛擬機器啟動完成。啟動記錄檔已附上。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A file couldn’t be read. Check that it is still in Files and downloaded, then try again." : {
      "comment" : "A line of the alert when a chosen file could not be opened or read: it was moved or deleted, or its storage did not hand it over.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルを読み込めませんでした。“ファイル”アプリにまだあり、ダウンロード済みであることを確認して、もう一度お試しください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取文件。请确认它仍在“文件”App中且已下载，然后重试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法讀取檔案。請確認它仍在「檔案」App中且已下載，然後再試一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A folder or a package can’t be attached. Compress it in Files first." : {
      "comment" : "A line of the alert when a chosen item is a folder or a package (a folder that looks like one file). Files is the iOS app; Compress is its menu item.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "フォルダまたはパッケージは添付できません。先に“ファイル”アプリで圧縮してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法附加文件夹或包。请先在“文件”App中将其压缩。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法附加檔案夾或套件。請先在「檔案」App中將其壓縮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add" : {
      "comment" : "The label of the bar's button that opens a menu to add photos, videos or files. The menu items are Photos and Files.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "追加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a photo or a file" : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says for the bar's Add button, which opens a menu with Photos and Files.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写真またはファイルを追加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加照片或文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入照片或檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add files" : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says for the Files item of the bar's Add menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ファイルを追加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入檔案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add photos or videos" : {
      "comment" : "What VoiceOver says for the Photos item of the bar's Add menu.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写真またはビデオを追加"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加照片或视频"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入照片或影片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An attachment is no longer available, so it was taken out of the list. Check the list, then send again." : {
      "comment" : "The message of the alert when Send finds that one attachment (a file, the bug report, the screenshot or a photo) added earlier is gone or can no longer be read, and takes it out of the list.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添付ファイルが利用できなくなったため、リストから削除しました。リストを確認して、もう一度送信してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某个附件已不可用，因此已从列表中移除。请检查列表，然后再次发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "某個附件已無法使用，因此已從列表中移除。請檢查列表，然後再傳送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "An empty file can’t be attached." : {
      "comment" : "A line of the alert when a chosen file has no content.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "空のファイルは添付できません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法附加空文件。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "無法附加空白檔案。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Andarium couldn’t open the mail composer." : {
      "comment" : "The text of that alert.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andariumはメール作成画面を開けませんでした。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andarium无法打开邮件撰写窗口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andarium無法打開郵件撰寫視窗。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Andarium makes its own copy of this file before attaching it. Large files take a while." : {
      "comment" : "The detail of the card shown while a picked file is copied before it is attached, a file the system has not downloaded, for one. Andarium is the app's name.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andariumがこのファイルのコピーを作成してから添付します。大きなファイルは時間がかかります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andarium会先拷贝此文件，然后再附加。大文件需要一些时间。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Andarium會先拷貝此檔案，然後再附加。大型檔案需要一些時間。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "APK files can’t be sent by mail" : {
      "comment" : "The title of the alert when a pick held only Android packages (.apk, and the bundles .apks, .xapk and .apkm): mail services reject a message that carries one, so none was attached. A line of the alert that lists several refusals says the same.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APKファイルはメールで送信できません"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APK文件无法通过邮件发送"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "APK檔案無法透過郵件傳送"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive" : {
      "comment" : "What a file of the bug report is, under its name and size, when it is an archive stored inside the report and opens like a folder.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アーカイブ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "归档文件"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "封存檔"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Archive, not shown" : {
      "comment" : "What an archive of the bug report is that cannot be opened here (it is compressed inside the report, or inside another archive), under its name and size.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "アーカイブ（表示されません）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
