    "For any bug, attach a bug report. It tells us what the virtual machine and the app were doing." : {
      "comment" : "The card over the bar while the virtual machine runs. The app is Andarium, an iOS app.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "どんなバグでも、バグレポートを添付してください。仮想マシンとアプリがそのとき何をしていたかがわかります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遇到任何错误时，请附上错误报告。它会告诉我们虚拟机和App当时在做什么。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "遇到任何錯誤時，請附上錯誤報告。它會告訴我們虛擬機器和App當時在做什麼。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Google licenses its apps and Google Play services only to makers of certified devices. Install apps from files you have; many work without them." : {
      "comment" : "The opened answer under \"Missing Google apps?\": why (Google licenses its apps and Google Play services only to makers of certified devices) and what to do. The same text as the boot screen's panel; Google stays in Latin letters in every language.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Googleは、自社のアプリとGoogle Play開発者サービスを、認定済みデバイスのメーカーにのみライセンス供与しています。お持ちのファイルからアプリを追加でき、多くはこれらなしで動作します。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google仅向认证设备的制造商授权其应用和Google Play服务。你可以用已有的文件安装应用，许多应用不需要这些服务也能使用。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Google只向認證裝置的製造商授權其應用程式和Google Play服務。你可以用手邊的檔案安裝應用程式，許多應用程式不需要這些服務也能使用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
