    "Mail services reject messages that carry an APK, so these files were not attached. Paste a download link for the app in the details instead." : {
      "comment" : "The text of that alert for two or more files, and the line of the longer alert for several packages. The details are the large field of the mail, where the link goes.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "メールサービスはAPKを含むメッセージを拒否するため、これらのファイルは添付されませんでした。代わりに、アプリのダウンロードリンクを詳細に貼り付けてください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "邮件服务会拒收带有APK的邮件，因此未附加这些文件。请改为在详细信息中粘贴该App的下载链接。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "郵件服務會拒收含有APK的郵件，因此未附加這些檔案。請改為在詳細資訊中貼上該App的下載連結。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Mail services reject messages that carry an APK, so this file was not attached. Paste a download link for the app in the details instead." : {
