    "Tap the side keys, then Settings › Send feedback, and attach a bug report." : {
      "comment" : "Step 3 of the way to a bug report, on the card shown from Home. The names are the ones of the side keys (Side keys, Settings, as the session's tip writes them) and of the row Send feedback… in Settings, without its ellipsis.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
