          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "感謝你協助改善Andarium。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s on purpose." : {
      "comment" : "The first words of the answer to the question above, as the headline of the opened answer: Android has no Google apps on purpose.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "意図的に搭載していません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是有意的。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是刻意的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That’s on purpose. Why" : {
      "comment" : "The collapsed form of the answer under the question above: the first words and the word that opens the rest. The last word is the string \"Why\" of this table, which is shown in the accent colour; Chinese and Japanese write no space between the two.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "意図的に搭載していません。理由"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这是有意的。原因"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "這是刻意的。原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file couldn’t be read." : {
      "comment" : "Said in the viewer when the attached file cannot be opened.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
