            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a bug report, a problem will most likely not get fixed." : {
      "comment" : "The first line of the card over the bar when the sheet was opened from Home, where no virtual machine runs. It says what a bug report is worth; the three steps under it say how to get one.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バグレポートがないと、問題はおそらく修正されません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有错误报告，问题很可能无法得到修复。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有錯誤報告，問題很可能無法修復。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without a bug report, a problem will most likely not get fixed. Send without one only if your message reports no problem, such as a suggestion or a question, or if you don’t want to attach it." : {
      "comment" : "The message of that alert. It says what a bug report is worth, and when sending without one is right.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "バグレポートがないと、問題はおそらく修正されません。メッセージが問題を報告するものでない場合（提案や質問など）や、添付したくない場合にのみ、バグレポートなしで送信してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没有错误报告，问题很可能无法得到修复。请仅在你的反馈不是报告问题（例如提出建议或提问），或你不想附上错误报告时，才不附带错误报告发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "沒有錯誤報告，問題很可能無法修復。請僅在你的回饋不是回報問題（例如提出建議或提問），或你不想附上錯誤報告時，才不附帶錯誤報告傳送。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write what went wrong in the Problem line, and describe what you did and what happened, then send again." : {
      "comment" : "The message of that alert when both the Problem line and the details are empty.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“問題”の行に何が問題だったかを、その下の欄に何をして何が起こったかを入力してから、もう一度送信してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“问题”行写下哪里出了问题，并在其下描述你做了什么、发生了什么，然后再次发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「問題」行寫下哪裡出了問題，並在其下描述你做了什麼、發生了什麼事，然後再傳送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write what went wrong in the Problem line, then send again." : {
      "comment" : "The message of that alert when only the Problem line is empty. Problem is the label of that line.",
      "localizations" : {
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "“問題”の行に、何が問題だったかを入力してから、もう一度送信してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "请在“问题”行写下哪里出了问题，然后再次发送。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "請在「問題」行寫下哪裡出了問題，然後再傳送一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version" : "1.0"
